# PROJECT REQUIREMENT: BUILD A COMPLETE DIGITAL IMAGE SELLING E-COMMERCE PLATFORM

Act as a senior Python Full-Stack Developer, Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, and Database Engineer.

Build a complete, functional, responsive Digital Image Selling E-commerce Website using Python Flask and MySQL.

The application must be developed end to end, with a professional frontend, functional backend, database integration, authentication, image management, shopping cart, order management, and admin dashboard.

IMPORTANT: DO NOT integrate any payment gateway. There must be no Razorpay, Stripe, PayPal, UPI, credit card, payment API, or real-money transaction functionality.

==================================================
1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
==================================================

Project Name: PixelMart – Digital Image Marketplace

Project Description:

PixelMart is an online marketplace where users can browse, search, explore, purchase, and download digital images.

The platform allows administrators to upload and manage digital images with titles, descriptions, categories, prices, and preview images.

Registered users can browse the marketplace, add images to their shopping cart, place demo orders without making any actual payment, and download images associated with their completed demo orders.

The application must have two main roles:

1. Customer
2. Administrator

Customer:
- Browse images.
- Search images.
- View image details.
- Add images to cart.
- Remove images from cart.
- Place demo orders.
- View order history.
- Download eligible purchased images.
- Manage their profile.

Administrator:
- Access admin dashboard.
- Upload images.
- Update image information.
- Delete images.
- Manage categories.
- View registered users.
- View all orders.
- Manage order statuses.
- View sales/order statistics.

